<title>HONG KONG: Taiwan Lite-on unit sets US$45 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Lite-on unit sets US$45 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating rate</p>
<p>note issue was announced by arranger Citicorp International.</p>
<p>BORROWER  LTC HK LTD</p>
<p>GURANTOR  LITE-ON TECHNOLOGY CORP</p>
<p> AMOUNT    US$45 MLN   COUPON     6ML+70 BP  MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	FRN	   ISS PRICE  PAR	  LAUNCH    25.OCT.96</p>
<p> PUTS	YR 3	  CALLS	YR 3 &amp; 4   REPLIES   15.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING   LUXEMBOURG  REPAYMENT  BULLET     DENOMS    $250/500K</p>
<p> RATING    --	    SALE LMTS  STANDARD   TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG   YES	   CRS DEF    YES	  FORCE KAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY TAIWAN	GOV LAW    ENGLISH    PAY DATE  --</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>		LEAD MANGERS  US$6 MLN+  20 BP  ALL-IN 76.6 BP</p>
<p>		MANAGERS	US$4-6 MLN 15 BP  ALL-IN 75   BP</p>
<p>		CO-MANAGERS   US$2-4 MLN 10 BP  ALL-IN 73.3 BP</p>
<p>ARRANGERS CITICORP INTERNATIONAL AND HSBC MARKETS</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
